<%# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    OBJECTIVES (WP2). Task ids are fixed by CONTRACT.md S8 and must not be
    renamed -- ink packages reference them in #complete_task tags, and taskOnKO
    / concludeRequires reference them here.

    Aim chain: commit_the_team -> reach_the_control_network -> {below_ground
    (side branch), reach_the_control_room -> take_the_attack_host ->
    end_the_sequence}. The vault aim hangs off the network aim rather than
    sitting in the chain, because the vault is optional lore and must never gate
    the conclusion.

    Aim `status: "locked"` is presentation only -- objectives-manager.js:412 and
    :543 auto-reveal a locked parent aim when one of its tasks completes -- so a
    locked aim can never strand a task. Every task therefore ships `active`.

    Anything a player can legitimately walk past (Hollis, Elena, Park, the
    vault, the lore drops) is `optional: true`, so aim completion never depends
    on content the player was allowed to skip.

    mission_complete and grid_saved are set from shut_down_the_cascade's
    onComplete.setGlobal -- the terminal, never a KO-able conversation.
%>
  "objectives": [
